      "writtenOn": "2022-08-30T14:21:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "MTLStorageModeStoreAndResolve is fairly slow, so we don\u0027t want to do it unless we have to. There are other issues with framebuffer-only, like dest read. I\u0027m wondering if we should require clients who want to use framebuffer-only to draw to an offscreen and blit that to the framebuffer.",
